    independent reimplementation of a documented concept.

Vendored methodology (the `--template kb` profile, under methodology/):

- kb-template (by a colleague of the maintainer) — the Markdown methodology:
    _schema/ policies (ingest, lint, citation, domain, page-types, naming,
    memory), _global/ working principles, AGENTS.md, and note templates.
